 reported as a warning, not a block. Off by default.\n      --results <path>                   Override the unsigned verify-results ledger feeding the keyless tier (default <data-root>/.use-cases/verification-results.jsonl).\n      --public-key <path>                Trusted public key to verify proof signatures (else proofs read UNPROVEN).\n      --keyring <path>                   Multi-key public-key registry (alternative to --public-key).\n      --generated-at <iso>               Override the generated-at timestamp.\n      --base-ref <ref>                   Diff base for the append-only check.\n      --ci                               CI mode (print inferred spans).\n\nAdd --json to any command for the machine-readable result envelope.\n","stderr":"","status":0,"config_after":null},{"name":"help_unmatched_tokens_fall_back_to_group","args":["doctor","nothing","--help"],"files":{},"stdout":"use-cases \u2014 the Use Cases CLI\n\nUsage: use-cases <command> [subcommand] [flags] [--json]\n\nCommands matching 'doctor nothing':\n  doctor roots  Report the resolved workspace and data roots.\n      --repo <path>                      Workspace root (defaults to the current directory).\n      --data-root <path>                 Override the data root (must stay inside --repo).\n      --component <id>                   Select a component within the workspace.\n      --json                             Emit the machine-readable JSON result envelope (default output is human-readable).\n\nAdd --json to any command for the machine-readable result envelope.\n","stderr":"","status":0,"config_after":null},{"name":"help_unmatched_everything","args":["nothing","at","all","--help"],"files":{},"stdout":"use-cases \u2014 the Use Cases CLI\n\nUsage: use-cases <command> [subcommand] [flags] [--json]\n\nCommands matching 'nothing at all':\n  version                      Print the CLI version.\n  init                         Scaffold a Use Cases workspace.\n  schema list                  List t