an                 Plan a demo capsule.\n  capsule run                  Run a demo capsule.\n  evidence record              Record an evidence event for a use case.\n  evidence status              Replay and report evidence-ledger completeness.\n  evidence void                Void an evidence aggregate at its expected head.\n  workflow set-mode            Persist the advisory workflow mode.\n  workflow mode                Print the effective advisory workflow mode.\n  doctor roots                 Report the resolved workspace and data roots.\n  bind                         Bind a use-case row to a code marker (inserts the marker into the source).\n  unbind                       Release a binding: remove its marker from the source and end its registration.\n  rebind                       Move a binding to a different declaration (marker and registration together).\n  scan                         Scan code markers against the bindings ledger and report freshness.\n  impact                       Show which bound behaviours a git change touches (advisory; re-verify the impacted ones).\n  prove                        Mint SIGNED proofs from verification results (CI-only signing key).\n  verify                       Run each bound row's verifier and write an UNSIGNED results ledger.\n  validate-ledger              Validate the marker evidence ledger (append-only, signatures, schema).\n  keygen                       Generate an ed25519 keypair for the opt-in signed proof tier.\n  recover                      Drive a drifted / unproven row back to green: re-verify (and optionally re-prove), then report.\n  showcase start               Start a showcase run from a plan file or an ad hoc selection.\n  showcase record-observation  Append an observation to a showcase run plan item.\n  showcase record-verdict      Append a verdict to a showcase run plan item.\n  showcase decide              Record a failure decision against a showcase verdict event.\n  showcase pause             